  "prefLabel": "Puc 1403.02 Annual Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1403.02 Annual Reporting.\n\n(a) Any owner or operator of a pipeline facility regulated by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission shall, with respect to any such pipeline facility located or to be located in New Hampshire, file with the commission:\n\n(1) Annually, on or before April 30 of each year, a copy of the signed original of the applicable Federal Energy Regulatory Commission annual report form (Form Number 2 or 2A) pertaining to such facility; and\n\n(2) Concurrently upon its filing with the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission, a copy of any application for a certification of public convenience and necessity under the Natural Gas Act, 15 U.S.C. § 717f(c), with respect to any pipeline facility proposed to be located in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #6445, eff 1-28-97 (formerly Puc 1401.01); ss by #8245, eff 12-31-04; ss by #10343, eff 5-22-13\n\nAppendix\n\nPuc 1401 | RSA 365:8, XII\n\nPuc 1402 | RSA 365:8, XII; RSA 374:15\n\nPuc 1403.01 | RSA 365:8, V and XII; RSA 374:15\n\nPuc 1403.02 | RSA 365:8, V and XII; RSAs 374:15\n\nAppendix B\n\nDOCUMENTS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE\n\nFEDERAL STANDARDS AND FORMS\n\n• Federal Energy Regulatory Commission Forms:\n\nForm Number 2 – Major Natural Gas Pipeline Annual Report (Puc 1403.02(a)(1))\n\nForm Number 2A – Non-Major Natural Gas Pipeline Annual Report (Puc 1403.02(a)(1))\n\nAvailable for downloading at no charge at: http://www.ferc.gov/docs-filing/forms.asp",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1400.html"
}
